        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara tu Rehoboamu ariphoimarisha ufalumewe na kuphaha nguvu, iye phamwenga na Aiziraeli osi aricha kulunga shariya ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaka wa tsano wa utawala wa mfalume Rehoboamu, Shishaki mfalume wa Misiri washambuliya Jerusalemu, mana Aiziraeli kala sio aaminifu kpwa Mwenyezi Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shishaki wakpwendavamia na magarige ga kuvwehwa ni farasi elufu mwenga na magana mairi na anajeshi akuhumira farasi elufu mirongo sita na anajeshi a kunyendeka na magulu asioolangika. Nao kala ni Alibiya, Asukii na Akushi ariokpwedza nao kula Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wateka midzi yosi ya Juda yokala na ngome, achedza hadi Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho nabii Shemaya achedza kpwa Rehoboamu na kpwa akulu a Juda ambao kala akakusanyika Jerusalemu kpwa kumuogopha Shishaki, achiambira, “Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi, ‘Mwimwi mwaniricha nami nkakurichani mikononi mwa Shishaki.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho akulu a Iziraeli na mfalume asononeka kpwa sababu ya makosa gao achiamba, “Mwenyezi Mlungu ndiye mwenye haki.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Mwenyezi Mlungu ariphoona kukala hinyo atu akasononekera makosa gao, Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba kutsupira Shemaya kuamba, “Akalalama sindaabananga ela nindaativya wala usiru wangu sindaumwagira Jerusalemu kutsupira mkpwono wa Shishaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela phahi andamuhumikira ili aphahe kumanya tafwauti kahi ya kunihumikira mimi na kuhumikira afalume a dunia.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
